      },
      "description": "gRPC's own meter, which keeps its pre-conventions instrument names - hence total_calls and calls_failed rather than anything beginning rpc_server_. It is the only place a gRPC status is visible at all, because the status rides in a trailer and every call is an HTTP 200 to everything else here. A failed call is not necessarily a fault: asking any replica about a stream it does not own answers NOT_FOUND, and that is how this API is meant to be used."
    },
